      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeo%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Romeo once thrived as a timber‑industry hub, with mills processing lumber from the surrounding forests.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeo%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dozens of stately Victorian mansions still line Romeo’s streets, a testament to its prosperous past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeo%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Romeo’s downtown has never suffered a major fire, preserving its historic streetscape for generations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
